==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}}  (symbol ''[[X]]'')

# {{context|physics|electrics|lang=en}} The [[opposition]] to the change in [[flow]] of current in an [[alternating current]] circuit, due to [[inductance]] and [[capacitance]]; the [[imaginary]] part of the [[impedance]].
# {{context|psychology|lang=en}} An [[emotional]] reaction in direct [[contradiction]] to rules or [[regulations]] that threaten or eliminate specific [[behavioral]] freedoms.

